    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "segmented",
      "description": "Language and theme switches: a box-2 well, the chosen segment a lifted box face.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\" role=\"group\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">বাংলা</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">English</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{display:inline-flex;padding:3px;gap:2px;border-radius:var(--r-sm);background:var(--box-2);border:1px solid var(--rule);} .ds-seg button{font:inherit;font-weight:600;min-height:34px;padding:.2rem .85rem;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;} .ds-seg button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--box);box-shadow:var(--shadow-box);} .ds-seg button:hover{color:var(--ink);} .ds-seg button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Marks",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "mark-done",
      "description": "The legend as pills: a dot plus words. Done, waiting, needs a person, SHEFA, live, gone.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-mark ds-ok\">নিশ্চিত</span> <span class=\"ds-mark ds-warn\">অপেক্ষায়</span> <span class=\"ds-mark ds-bad\">মানুষ দরকার</span> <span class=\"ds-mark ds-shefa\">শেফা বুক করেছে</span> <span class=\"ds-mark ds-live\">চলছে</span> <span class=\"ds-mark ds-gone\">বাতিল</span>",
      "css": ".ds-mark{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;min-height:1.65rem;padding:.05rem .65rem;border-radius:var(--r-pill);border:1px solid transparent;background:var(--box-2);color:var(--ink-2);font-size:var(--step--1);font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap;} .ds-mark::before{content:\"\";flex:none;width:.5rem;height:.5rem;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;} .ds-ok{background:var(--done-wash);color:var(--done-ink);} .ds-warn{background:var(--waiting-wash);color:var(--waiting-ink);} .ds-bad{background:var(--urgent);color:var(--on-urgent);} .ds-shefa{background:var(--shefa-wash);color:var(--shefa-ink);} .ds-live{background:var(--shefa);color:var(--on-shefa);} .ds-live::before{animation:ds-pulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;} @keyframes ds-pulse{50%{opacity:.25;}} .ds-gone{background:transparent;color:var(--ink-3);text-decoration:line-through;} .ds-gone::before{display:none;} @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-live::before{animation:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Doctor Name Block",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "doc-name",
      "description": "A doctor's name reversed out of their box colour, as printed on the box.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-doc-name\" style=\"--doc:var(--doc-1)\">ডা. এ. করিম</span> <span class=\"ds-doc-name\" style=\"--doc:var(--doc-2)\">ডা. এন. সুলতানা</span> <span class=\"ds-doc-chip\" style=\"--doc:var(--doc-3)\">ডা. আর. হোসেন</span>",
      "css": ".ds-doc-name{display:inline-block;padding:.1rem .6rem;border-radius:var(--r-sm);background:var(--doc,var(--ink-2));color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;line-height:1.45;} .ds-doc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;font-weight:600;} .ds-doc-chip::before{content:\"\";width:.75rem;height:.75rem;border-radius:3px;background:var(--doc,var(--ink-3));}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Batch Stamp",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Serials and references printed like a carton MFG/EXP block: dashed frame, tabular digits.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-stamp\">১৯/২৪ <small>সিরিয়াল</small></span>",
      "css": ".ds-stamp{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.35rem;padding:.05rem .5rem;border:1.5px dashed currentColor;border-radius:4px;color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.35;} .ds-stamp small{font-family:var(--font);font-weight:600;font-size:.7em;opacity:.8;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rail Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "rail",
      "description": "The pharma-green rail: Lucide icon tiles, the active item a white box, the legend at the foot.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\"><a class=\"ds-nav ds-active\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-ic\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.9 19.1C1 15.2 1 8.8 4.9 4.9\"/><path d=\"M7.8 16.2c-2.3-2.3-2.3-6.1 0-8.5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16.2 7.8c2.3 2.3 2.3 6.1 0 8.5\"/><path d=\"M19.1 4.9C23 8.8 23 15.1 19.1 19\"/></svg></span>এখন</a><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-ic\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4\"/><path d=\"M8 2v4\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18\"/></svg></span>অ্যাপয়েন্টমেন্ট</a><dl class=\"ds-legend\"><div><dt style=\"background:var(--urgent)\"></dt><dd>মানুষ দরকার</dd></div><div><dt style=\"background:var(--waiting)\"></dt><dd>অপেক্ষায়</dd></div><div><dt style=\"background:oklch(0.7 0.13 158)\"></dt><dd>হয়ে গেছে</dd></div><div><dt style=\"background:oklch(0.7 0.14 262)\"></dt><dd>শেফা করছে</dd></div></dl></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;width:16rem;padding:1rem .75rem;background:var(--rail);color:var(--rail-ink);border-radius:var(--r);--focus:oklch(0.9 0.1 90);} .ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;min-height:44px;padding:.35rem .5rem;border-radius:var(--r-sm);color:var(--rail-ink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;} .ds-nav:hover{background:var(--rail-hover);} .ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px;} .ds-ic{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:1.9rem;height:1.9rem;border-radius:7px;background:oklch(1 0 0 / .14);color:#fff;} .ds-active{background:var(--box);color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow-box);} .ds-active .ds-ic{background:var(--primary);} .ds-active:hover{background:var(--box);} .ds-legend{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.35rem .6rem;margin:1rem 0 0;padding:.75rem .5rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rail-rule);font-size:var(--step--2);color:var(--rail-ink-2);} .ds-legend div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;} .ds-legend dt{width:.7rem;height:.7rem;border-radius:50%;} .ds-legend dd{margin:0;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Today's Chambers Row",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "box",
      "description": "One doctor's session on the day axis: name block, a bar filling in the doctor's colour, booked/capacity in a stamp.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-box\"><div class=\"ds-load\" style=\"--doc:var(--doc-1)\"><span class=\"ds-load-name\">ডা. এ. করিম</span><div class=\"ds-track\"><div class=\"ds-block\" style=\"left:2%;width:46%\"><div class=\"ds-fill\" style=\"width:79%\"></div><span class=\"ds-count\"><span class=\"ds-lstamp\">১৯/২৪</span></span></div></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-box{background:var(--box);border-radius:var(--r);box-shadow:var(--shadow-box);padding:1rem 1.5rem;} .ds-load{display:grid;grid-template-columns:12rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem;align-items:center;min-height:3.4rem;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);} .ds-load-name{padding:.35rem .7rem;border-radius:var(--r-sm);background:var(--doc);color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;} .ds-track{position:relative;height:2.5rem;} .ds-block{position:absolute;top:.45rem;bottom:.45rem;border-radius:var(--r-sm);overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--doc) 14%,var(--box));border:1.5px solid var(--doc);} .ds-fill{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;background:var(--doc);} .ds-count{position:relative;z-index:1;margin-inline-start:.35rem;} .ds-lstamp{display:inline-flex;padding:.05rem .5rem;border:1.5px dashed var(--doc);border-radius:4px;background:var(--box);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:var(--step--1);}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Medicine Shelf",
    "overview": "SHEFA looks like a Bangladeshi pharmacy shelf, read as a working screen. Bright white box board sits on a warm off-white shelf. A deep pharma-green rail runs down the staff app and across the top of every public page. Solid colour label blocks carry reversed bold type, the way a medicine box prints its brand name. Serials and references are printed in a dashed batch stamp with tabular digits, like the MFG/EXP block on a carton. Every doctor wears their own box colour across the whole product, so the desk finds a doctor's sessions, list and patients by colour, the way a pharmacist reaches for the right box.\n\nStatus is a printed legend: one colour, one meaning, everywhere, and always with words beside the colour. Red means a caller needs a person, or there is a clash or an error. Amber means waiting. Green means done, and green is also the colour of going ahead. SHEFA blue means SHEFA itself: a live call, a booking it made, its side of a transcript. Gone is grey and struck through. The legend sits at the foot of the rail on desktop and repeats on the page on a phone.\n\nThe density is a working desk's, but friendly and local rather than austere. Bangla comes first. Type is round and bold for names and the numbers that matter (Baloo Da 2) and plain and readable for everything else (Hind Siliguri). Corners are small, and boxes sit on the shelf with a soft shadow. The world has a light shelf and an after-hours dark shelf, chosen by the device or by the viewer.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "White boxes on a warm shelf; a pharma-green rail or top bar.",
      "One colour, one meaning: urgent red, waiting amber, done green, SHEFA blue, gone grey, always with words.",
      "Six doctor box colours that never collide with the legend hues.",
      "Reversed name blocks and dashed batch stamps borrowed from medicine packaging.",
      "Baloo Da 2 for names, headings and numbers that matter; Hind Siliguri for body and data.",
      "Light and dark shelves, with a three-way theme switch (follow device, light, dark)."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Colour, One Meaning Rule",
        "body": "Each legend hue means one thing on every surface: red needs a person, amber waits, green is done or go, blue is SHEFA, grey struck through is gone. Never use a legend hue for decoration, and never let colour speak without a word beside it.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Box Colour Rule",
        "body": "Doctors wear only the six doc colours, which sit clear of the legend hues. A doctor's colour appears wherever that doctor does (name block, session bar, box band, chip). A clash overrides the doctor's colour with urgent red.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Shelves Rule",
        "body": "Every colour has a dark-shelf value (see the sidecar). The theme is chosen by `prefers-color-scheme`, unless `:root[data-theme]` forces light or dark. Surfaces read tokens and never hard-code a light value. On the dark shelf, text on a solid green, blue or red fill turns dark (the on-done, on-shefa and on-urgent values), so the fills keep their hue and stay legible.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Label Voice Rule",
        "body": "Baloo Da 2 is for what the box shouts (names, headings, numbers that matter, buttons, stamps). Never set paragraphs or table data in it on staff surfaces, where Hind Siliguri is loaded.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Digits Rule",
